Engine loop, skid loop, and smoke sprite from Kenney's Starter Kit Racing
(https://github.com/KenneyNL/Starter-Kit-Racing).

The sounds and the smoke sprite are CC0. The skid sound was made by Landeplage
(https://github.com/Landeplage) and is also CC0.

The vehicle control script those assets were built for is MIT. The port lives
in js/kenney-vehicle.js and keeps that notice.
